# .lhg/filesize.ignore — gitignore-style patterns for the file-size guard.
# One pattern per line. "#" starts a comment; blank lines are ignored.
# Trailing "/" matches a directory tree; "*"/"?"/"[...]" are globs.
# An empty file means: nothing is ignored. Docs: 60-hooks.md

# dist/bundle.js
# vendor/
# *.woff
